# Select the "local" environment in the run gutter, or {{host}} stays unsubstituted.
# local = php artisan serve (:8000), sail = ./vendor/bin/sail up (:80)

### Default channel -> 202
POST {{host}}/api/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Sending by default channel."
}

### Explicit channel and level -> 202
POST {{host}}/api/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Sending by file channel.",
  "channel": "file",
  "level": "warning"
}

### Every channel -> 202 when all deliver, 207 when some fail, 502 when none do
POST {{host}}/api/logs/broadcast
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Sending by every channel."
}

### Unknown channel -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Sending nowhere.",
  "channel": "carrier-pigeon"
}

### Missing message -> 422
POST {{host}}/api/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{}
